Database credentials live in `app/.env`.

The Docker Compose stack is started with `--env-file ./app/.env`, so the MySQL container and Laravel app stay in sync without duplicating credentials in `docker-compose.yml`.

To set up and run the application, use the appropriate setup script for your operating system:

-- setup.sh (Mac/Linux)
chmod +x setup.sh
./setup.sh

-- setup.bat (Windows)
Double click .bat file
